ow overexpression  0 to 1   no minimal immunoreactivity or  incomplete membrane staining of tumor cells     Show moderate  2   overexpression  weak to moderate complete membrane  immunoreactivity in   10  of tumor cells     Show strong  3   overexpression  strong complete membrane  immunoreactivity in   30  of tumor cells     These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by  the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not  been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The  FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this  laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision            Electronically Signed Out By  Atul K Bhan MBBS  MD on REMOVED_DATE 13 47     Addendum            FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION    Lymph Node  Left Axillary  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  Amplified   See note     Note  Reliable enumeration of HER 2 and chromosome 17 signals is not possible  due to clumping of signals and increased chromosome 17 signals  Dr  John  Iafrate has also reviewed the FISH test and agrees that the HER 2 neu gene is  amplified in the tumor cells in this case     Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals to chromosome 17  signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE  indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using  PathVysion by Vysis     The results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be  interpreted with caution  Equivocal Amplification    Reference  Journal of Clinical Oncology 25 118 145   REMOVED_CASE_ID             Electronically Signed Out By  Atul K Bhan MBBS  MD on REMOVED_DATE 15 06       CLINICAL HISTORY  74 year old female with newly diagnosed metastatic recurrent breast cancer by  new lymphadenop