e B cell lymphoma  DLBCL  remains unchanged     Stains performed on the earlier tibial biopsy   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   see addended  report  demonstrate that the original lymphoma cells also co expressed  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   These additional findings confirm aberrant antigen expression of certain  T cell markers   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   by the large B cell lymphoma and support that the  findings in the current specimen represent recurrence persistence of the  patient s previously diagnosed DLBCL     This immunoperoxidase test was developed and its performance characteristics  determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital   It has not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration   FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not  necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and  precision               Addendum  1 by Aliyah Sohani M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH  21   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 05 54PM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses     PART   Liver   Biopsy       report_end  , Yes.
