  The specimen is inked as follows  Superior green  anterior yellow  anterior blue  and posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable yellow white fibrofatty cut surface  The specimen is submitted in its entirety from lateral to medial in blocks  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Jennifer Nash  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Paula Arnell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Paula Arnell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Paula Arnell M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION  1 PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION  2 PART C  BREAST  RIGHT ADDITIONAL   EXCISION , No.
