fied in the attached axillary tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE A B  Biopsy cavity and adjacent tissue C  Biopsy cavity and closest anterior margin D  Mottled tissue adjacent to biopsy cavity E  Closest deep margin to biopsy cavity F  0 5cm nodule G  Fibrotic tissue from medial area H I  Axillary tissue Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  additional axillary tissue  is a 3 x 2 x 1cm fibroadipose fragment  bisected and submitted in cassettes J K  Resident  MASSIMO D APUZZO  MD PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST   AXILLARY TISSUE LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  AXILLARY TISSUE EXCISION , Not_reported.
